# The repo-root .gitignore already covers node_modules/, dist/ and .expo/ at
# any depth — checked with `git check-ignore -v apps/mobile/.expo`, which
# reports .gitignore:17. Only what it does not cover belongs here.

# Metro leaves this behind when a dev server exits badly.
.metro-health-check*

# `expo prebuild` writes real native projects here. This app runs in Expo Go
# and nothing in CI prebuilds it, so if these appear they were generated
# locally and are not source.
/android
/ios
